    "catalogue_description": "Hey guys! Have you ever wanted to be a superhero amongst the undead? Well, you can quit dreaming! Malibu Drive brings the Avengers to the world of COD Zombies. Play as all your favorite heroes from Avengers: Age of Ultron including Iron Man, Captain America, Thor, Vision, Hulk, Quicksilver, Scarlet Witch, Black Widow, War Machine, Hawkeye and even Spider-Man (Spidey is an Avenger in the comics, don\u2019t give me grief ) The map features a VERY large world to explore and a massive easter egg requiring the use of all the Avengers and their abilities. Get ready to dive into a world of superpowered action!!! NOTE: Please be aware that you may experience lag or other problems if you are using a low-end PC or components not supported by Call of Duty: World at War _____________________________________________________________________________ A very special thanks to the folks that helped me with random stuff! Please take a moment to recognize them for their help OfftheWall: Player models, targeting, random script advice Redspace: thunder punch, boost, random script advice ASTR0: Character icon images ipwnatzombies: Main Menu Gerards0406: Hitmarkers Chromeastone10: random help with little stuff RDV: hugging zombies __________________________ Map Testers NascarFanatic24 Chromastone10 TheScotchGuy DeathBringerZen",
